WEBVTT

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:31.856
Today, approximately 40 percent
of our planet is farmland.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.776
Spread all over the world,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.521
these agricultural lands
are the pieces to a global puzzle

00:00:37.545 --> 00:00:39.186
we are all facing:

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:44.446
in the future, how can we feed
every member of a growing population

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:46.215
a healthy diet?

00:00:46.859 --> 00:00:48.536
Meeting this goal will require

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:52.625
nothing short of a second
agricultural revolution.

00:00:52.649 --> 00:00:54.646
The first agricultural revolution

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:58.736
was characterized
by expansion and exploitation,

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:03.591
feeding people at the expense
of forests, wildlife and water